  "strategy": "Within the unchanged 256 solver / 1024 iteration / 65536 charged-sample ledger, temporarily reserve one full continued solver allowance after the current connection is certified. Cold checks reaching their ceiling are deferred, never globally poisoned; all original candidate rollouts remain single-pass. Release the reserve before the old recovery order, only when no ordinary certified best exists. Prior work remains charged. A shortfall holds the available remainder and still attempts complete certification under the total cap.",
  "reservation_formula": {
    "solvers": 1,
    "iterations": 8,
    "charged_samples": "32 * (ceil(min(distance + period*max(measured_speed,speed_upper), 2*lookahead, 2) * pi/2 / min(grid_resolution/3, .025)) + 2)",
    "basis": "Each of eight correction iterations has one residual + three finite-difference evaluations; each evaluation samples two segments totaling at most distance*pi/2. Extra two samples cover separate rounding and floating rounding. Checked integer accounting; reservation is not added to consumed work."
  },
